{
"id": "claude-code-shortcuts-structured",
"title": "4 Claude Code Shortcuts Worth Learning",
"fps": 30,
"width": 1080,
"height": 1920,
"scenes": [
{
"id": "hook",
"type": "hook-centered",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "text-only",
"vo": "If you use Claude Code, memorize these four shortcuts.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "USING",
"size": "title",
"animation": "slideDown"
},
{
"text": "CLAUDE CODE?",
"size": "hero",
"pill": true,
"animation": "pop",
"sfx": "d-pop"
},
{
"text": "MEMORIZE THESE 4",
"size": "headline",
"animation": "slideUp"
}
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "corner-props",
"assets": [
{
"type": "tool-logo",
"tool": "claude"
}
],
"diagonal": "tlbr",
"size": 460,
"speed": 0.8
},
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "cut",
"stagger": 5,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-one",
"type": "hook-centered",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Number one. Escape, Escape.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "01",
"size": "hero",
"pill": true,
"animation": "pop"
},
{
"text": "ESC + ESC",
"size": "headline",
"animation": "slideUp"
},
{
"text": "REWIND",
"size": "label",
"animation": "slideUp"
}
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "keycap",
"keys": [
"ESC",
"ESC"
],
"caption": "open checkpoint menu"
},
"visualSfx": "d-tick",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-one-explained",
"type": "visual-explainer",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Claude took your code in the wrong direction? Escape twice opens your checkpoints so you can jump back.",
"content": {
"eyebrow": "WHY IT MATTERS",
"headline": "CLAUDE MESSED SOMETHING UP?",
"highlights": [
"MESSED"
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "transform",
"from": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"transcript": [
{
"text": "fix the login redirect",
"kind": "user"
},
{
"text": "editing auth.ts...",
"kind": "tool"
},
{
"text": "editing router.ts...",
"kind": "dim"
}
]
},
"to": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"overlay": {
"title": "rewind to a checkpoint",
"items": [
{
"text": "before login changes",
"selected": true
},
{
"text": "after auth update"
},
{
"text": "session start"
}
]
}
},
"holdFrames": 34
},
"visualSfx": "d-select",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-two",
"type": "hook-centered",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Number two. Shift Tab.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "02",
"size": "hero",
"pill": true,
"animation": "pop"
},
{
"text": "SHIFT + TAB",
"size": "headline",
"animation": "slideUp"
},
{
"text": "CHANGE MODE",
"size": "label",
"animation": "slideUp"
}
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "keycap",
"keys": [
"SHIFT",
"TAB"
],
"caption": "cycle permission modes"
},
"visualSfx": "d-tick",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-two-explained",
"type": "visual-explainer",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "For bigger changes, cycle into Plan mode. Claude can inspect the problem and propose the approach before editing your code.",
"content": {
"eyebrow": "WHY IT MATTERS",
"headline": "PLAN BEFORE YOU LET IT EDIT",
"highlights": [
"PLAN"
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "transform",
"from": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"transcript": [
{
"text": "refactor authentication",
"kind": "user"
},
{
"text": "ready to edit files",
"kind": "tool"
}
],
"mode": "accept edits",
"modeActive": true
},
"to": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"transcript": [
{
"text": "1. inspect auth flow",
"kind": "result"
},
{
"text": "2. find affected files",
"kind": "result"
},
{
"text": "3. propose minimal change",
"kind": "result"
}
],
"mode": "plan mode",
"modeActive": true
},
"holdFrames": 34
},
"visualSfx": "d-select",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-three",
"type": "hook-centered",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Number three. Control R.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "03",
"size": "hero",
"pill": true,
"animation": "pop"
},
{
"text": "CTRL + R",
"size": "headline",
"animation": "slideUp"
},
{
"text": "FIND OLD PROMPTS",
"size": "label",
"animation": "slideUp"
}
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "keycap",
"keys": [
"CTRL",
"R"
],
"caption": "reverse search history"
},
"visualSfx": "d-tick",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-three-explained",
"type": "visual-explainer",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Remember that perfect prompt from earlier? Control R searches backwards through your prompt history instead of making you type it again.",
"content": {
"eyebrow": "WHY IT MATTERS",
"headline": "STOP REWRITING OLD PROMPTS",
"highlights": [
"STOP"
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"overlay": {
"title": "search history: deploy",
"items": [
{
"text": "deploy app to staging",
"selected": true
},
{
"text": "fix deploy script"
},
{
"text": "inspect deploy logs"
}
]
}
},
"visualSfx": "d-select",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-four",
"type": "hook-centered",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Number four. At plus a path.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "04",
"size": "hero",
"pill": true,
"animation": "pop"
},
{
"text": "@ + PATH",
"size": "headline",
"animation": "slideUp"
},
{
"text": "GIVE CONTEXT",
"size": "label",
"animation": "slideUp"
}
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "keycap",
"keys": [
"@"
],
"caption": "reference a file or folder"
},
"visualSfx": "d-tick",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "shortcut-four-explained",
"type": "visual-explainer",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "Instead of explaining your code in a giant prompt, reference the actual file or folder and let Claude read the context.",
"content": {
"eyebrow": "WHY IT MATTERS",
"headline": "STOP EXPLAINING YOUR OWN CODE",
"highlights": [
"STOP"
]
},
"visual": {
"type": "transform",
"from": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"input": "the login file has a bug..."
},
"to": {
"type": "claude-cli",
"transcript": [
{
"text": "@src/auth/login.ts",
"kind": "user"
},
{
"text": "reading login.ts",
"kind": "tool"
},
{
"text": "context loaded",
"kind": "result"
}
],
"input": "fix the redirect bug"
},
"holdFrames": 34
},
"visualSfx": "d-done",
"motion": {
"entrance": "slideUp",
"transition": "slideLeft",
"stagger": 6,
"sfx": "none"
}
},
{
"id": "bonus",
"type": "takeaway",
"background": "solid-dark",
"layout": "visual-bottom",
"vo": "And if you forget any of these, press question mark. Claude shows the shortcuts available in your setup.",
"content": {
"richHeadline": [
{
"text": "BONUS",
